// A two-part sailplane: a slim tail boom carrying the tailplane and fin, tapering up into
// the cabin, which carries the wing. Nothing separates (`sequences: []`). Stick: pitch
// (elevator), yaw (rudder) and roll (ailerons); trimmed to glide hands off at about 38 m/s.
